# market-desk session bootstrap

Before planning or implementing work under `apps/market-desk/`:

1. Read `apps/market-desk/TODO.md` (Open / Done / Won’t do).
2. Prefer picking an **Open** item unless the user asks for something else.
3. When finishing a backlog item, mark it done in `TODO.md` and note what shipped in one line.
4. Soft-scoring philosophy: nudge size/score/bands. **Decision agency (2026-10-31):** pull `GET /api/ops/agent-pack` (or Actions Agent pack dump / localhost `/api/internal/agent-pack`); Agent judges against pre-registered TODO thresholds and ships soft (then hard after ≥2w re-pass) without waiting for a verbal nod. Read `dual_wins` (`abs_win` vs `xs_win`) and sim `vs_bench` — rule changes use relative/excess; start-gate stays absolute. `proposals.sample=ready` + `verdict=hold` is the default; `soft_candidate` only hints — still apply full TODO metrics before shipping. Still: no hard gate before the threshold; never change thresholds after seeing the numbers; first live-broker connect needs one explicit confirm.
5. **Data compat**: any schema / scoring / enum change must keep existing `desk.db` workable (see `market-desk-data-compat`).
6. **版本更新记录 (CHANGELOG)**：每次功能更新或优化后，必须在 `apps/market-desk/CHANGELOG.md` 中追加条目，严格写明「为什么做（Why · 痛点与动机）」与「做了什么（What · 改动详情）」以及「实盘影响」，并保持 `TODO.md` 同步。
7. **本地优先提交与发布规约**：可在本地分支（如 `market-desk-local`）优先 commit 归档；严禁在 go-learning 直接 push；发布必须通过 robocopy 同步至 `D:\Source\Repos\market-desk` 并在该仓库 commit & push GitHub（详见 `go-learning-branch-policy`）。
8. **文件体量**：单个源码文件控制在约 1,300 行以内；超出时按 `TODO.md`「工程：大文件拆分」的做法拆成包并保持原导入路径。`verdict` / `engine` / `review` / `eastmoney` / `elliott` / `adapt` 均已是包，新增逻辑放进对应子模块，不要再堆回一个文件；`DeskEngine` 新方法放进对应 mixin。样式在 `static/css/desk/NN-*.css`、脚本在 `static/js/desk/NN-*.js`，编号即加载/层叠顺序。拆包时被 `global` 重新绑定的模块状态必须与其全部读写函数同处一个子模块；测试 monkeypatch 要指向实际查找该名字的子模块。
